  "contracts": [
    "51CC00 reuses Unit02333 signed16-sector algorithm, thresholds499/199/-200/-500 and equal-coordinate behavior. SUB/NEG wrap32. Reuse solved4CDE60 percentage C; preserve its sole signed-division overflow through real IDIV(INT_MIN,-1), rather than silently replacing it with zero. Sole direct4B4220 consumer stores AL, so public API is uint8; upper EAX/flags/indirect continuations are not invented.",
    "4B4220 reuses complete MenuDragActorMove algorithm. Actual record baseBCD5F8 and stride184. Preserve WORD target4E/50, delta52/54, signed comparisons, lowWORD error56, BYTE axis58 and mode-dependent16/8-way directions. Retain signed WORD reloads after child calls and diagonal adjustments. New record union overlays old monument fields and keeps building_id/owner_walker_id alias5A; all other foreign header edits excluded from canonical checkpoint.",
    "53B4A0 reuses complete ActorSound algorithm with actual Native data. Live Ghidra confirms2 jump targets at53B60C and all91 remap bytes at53B614:exact16 offscreen-capable walker kinds; pan float570150 is exact128.0. Keep signed upper guards only, sample<=-1 gate and actual global widths. Initial width always reads fullscreen width before optional window width, as Native does. Height captured before coordinate child; width selected again for pan after child.",
    "53B4A0 pixel output slots originally contain sound and walker_id. Seed x=sound,y=walker_id rather than old C uninitialized locals; city conversion may return without touching outputs for unsupported orientations. No fabricated zero defaults.",
    "Pan keeps inherited x87 FILD/FDIVR/FILD/FMUL order. Product is transferred through exact10-byte extended storage to canonical56133C; lower32 result becomes pan. The remaining width ratio stays live through truncation and is popped afterward, correcting old wrapper cleanup order. Extra extended transfer preserves value; arbitrary exceptional FP-stack/status domains remain unclaimed.",
    "4B5210 is actual combat SOUND dispatch:11/12/13/17 with variant2, Native default no action. It is not name assignment or owner refresh. Real C53B4A0 calls actual digital sound and projection providers; sound operations must be bound, no placeholder.",
    "4B45C0 reuses complete old Targeting.c parent and real4B4800 create. Read EAAC28 as DWORD, pass logical lowBYTE owner. Return0 only when real create returns0. Combat sound precedes projectile initialization. Kind3D damage60 else10; ownerWORD aliases building_id at5A; destination signedWORDs are multiplied by15. Use actual cross-country fields4A/4C, setup mode1 and complete full-C asin-based angle with actual math environment. Store only AL direction."
  ],
